sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Delivery coordinator
    participant A as Repository A
    participant B as Repository B
    D->>D: Freeze approved scope and all exact-head evidence
    D->>D: Validate all readiness and dependency order
    D->>A: Submit merge with expected head
    A--xD: Acknowledgment lost
    D->>D: Record OutcomeUnknown
    D->>A: Observe ticket and PR merge evidence
    A-->>D: Merged with actual commit
    D->>D: Persist A merged without resubmission
    D->>B: Reobserve expected head and readiness
    alt B head changed
        B-->>D: Changed head
        D->>D: Hold B and retain A merge
    else B still eligible
        D->>B: Submit merge
        B-->>D: Accepted or queued
        D->>B: Observe PR until authoritative outcome
        B-->>D: Merged with actual commit
        D->>D: Complete delivery with separate cleanup and release
    end
